        <p>AWONDERFUL DISCOVERY.—This is the age of research and experiment, when all nature, so to speak. is ransacked by the scientific for tile comfort and happiness of man. Science has indeed made giant stride. during the past century, and among the--by no means least impertant—discoveries in medicine comes that of</p>
