        <p>Goals. Tries. Points. Cooke J. Davies Swift Short Morrison</p>
        <p>Fish has also scored 5 points for the County, making his total for the season 100 points, or 26 goals 16 triee. The Northern League table for 1904-5 stands as fol- lows :</p>
