        <p>The" A" team has also had a remarkably successful season' which terminated on Saturday with the capture of the Lancashire Combination medals, after a very close race With Wigan" A." During the season 27 matches have been played, 23 being won, 3 lost, and one drawn. The points for are 43 goals, 92 tries, 362 points, against 15 goals. 21 tries, 102 points. I The following are the "A" team scorers : Goals. Tries. Points. Berry 8 ... 14 ... 58 Knight Short — 15 ... 45 Foster Jordan Brookes J. Davies Kenyon Harris Savage Jackson R. Bate Duckworth „Barnes Lunt Ashton Roberts Watkins Dickinson 1 ... 1 ... 5 Morrison , W. Bate The Lancalaire combination table, complete is as follows: P. W. D. L. Pts. Warrington (A) Wigan (A) 22 ... 16 ... 4 ... 2 ... 36 Chadderton Oldham (A) 22 ... 9 ... 6 ... 7 ... 24 Widnes (A) 22 ... 8 ... 7 ... 7 ... 23 Broughton R'g'rs(A) 22 ... 9 ... 4 ... 9 ... 22 St. Helens (A) 22 ... 9 ... 4 ... 9 ... 22 Leigh (A) Swinton (A) Rochdale IL (A) 22 ... 3 ... 7 ... 12 ... 13 Runcorn(A) 22 ... 5 ... 2 ... 15 ... 12 Salford (A) 22 ... 1 ... 5 16 ... 7</p>
